msgid "✦ PLANT HEALTH & HOW TO REVIVE"
msgstr "✦ PFLANZENGESUNDHEIT & BELEBUNG"

#: ui.lua:225
msgid "Each room's plant has its own Plant Health (0% – 100%) and natural growth pace:"
msgstr "Jede Pflanze besitzt eigene Lebenspunkte (0% – 100%) und ihr eigenes Wuchstempo:"

#: ui.lua:229
msgid "Extreme heat/cold, sour/chalky soil, or hazards left right next to a plant slowly lower that plant's health."
msgstr "Extreme Hitze/Kälte, saurer/kalkiger Boden oder Gefahren direkt neben einer Pflanze senken langsam ihre LP."

